# The kind node image the end-to-end suite runs on: the one reference both
# e2e/run.sh (kind create cluster --image) and the e2e job of ci.yml
# (helm/kind-action's node_image) read, so the two cannot drift. One
# non-comment line, by tag AND digest: kind's release notes say the digest is
# what guarantees an image built for that kind release.
#
# Source: the default node image of kind v0.31.0, the kind version ci.yml
# pins, from its release notes
# (https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kind/releases/tag/v0.31.0), for the
# Kubernetes minor the suite is developed against. To bump it, take the new
# kind release's image for the wanted minor from its notes, write it here and
# move the `version` of helm/kind-action in ci.yml to that kind release; a
# kept cluster (E2E_KEEP_CLUSTER=1) made from the old image is reused as is
# until it is deleted.
